<div class="vas-info mt50">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12">
            <h2 class="vas-title">Introduction</h2>

            <p class="mt20" style="text-align: justify;">Voluntary Agreement Scheme on Energy Efficiency in Energy Intensive Industries (VAS Program) is an initiative under Component 03 &ndash; Low carbon development in the industrial sector &ndash; within the framework of the Energy Partnership Program between Vietnam and Denmark 2020&ndash;2025 (DEPP3).</p>

            <p class="mt20" style="text-align: justify;">The VAS Program aims to promote energy efficiency in industrial sectors by providing technical support for enterprises. This helps them identify significant energy efficiency opportunities, enhance production efficiency, reduce greenhouse gas emissions, and move towards green production in line with global trends.&nbsp;</p>

            <div class="mt20 text-center viewmore-btn"><a class="btn-cm btn-blue" href="#">More</a></div>

            <div class="viewmore-content mt30">
                <p><strong>WHICH ENTERPRISES CAN PARTICIPATE IN THE VAS PROGRAM?</strong></p>

                <ul class="tick-list mt5">
                    <li>(i) The enterprise must be a designated energy user;</li>
                    <li>(ii) They need to be genuinely interested in energy efficiency;</li>
                    <li>(iii) They are ready to invest in potential energy efficiency projects.</li>
                </ul>

                <p class="mt20"><strong>HOW TO REGISTER FOR PARTICIPATION?</strong></p>

                <p class="mt5">Enterprises interested in joining the VAS Program can contact the project&rsquo;s technical consultant for detailed guidance:</p>

                <p class="mt10"><strong>Mr. Nguyen Thanh Ha</strong></p>

                <ul class="info-list">
                    <li><img src="/Content/img/vas/vas-icon-email.png" /> ha.nguyen@rcee.org.vn</li>
                    <li><img src="/Content/img/vas/vas-icon-phone.png" /> 0916 942 624</li>
                </ul>

                <div class="mt20 text-center hidden-btn"><a class="btn-cm btn-blue" href="#">Hide</a></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-6 col-sm-12"><iframe height="480" src="https://www.google.com/maps/d/embed?mid=1dKJdobSmwBo6_YhlQOjC4_mtE2KM7OY&amp;ehbc=2E312F&amp;z=5" width="100%"></iframe></div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="vas-support pt60 pb60">
    <h2 class="vas-title text-center">Technical support</h2>

    <div class="mt30">
        <div class="vas-support-list">
            <div class="vas-support-item">
                <div>
                    <div class="vas-support-img">
                        <img src="/Content/img/vas/vas-img-01.jpg" />
                        <p class="vas-num"><span>1</span></p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="vas-support-content">
                        <p class="vas-support-name">Preparation</p>

                        <p class="mt10">To participate in the Voluntary Agreement Scheme, enterprises need to:</p>

                        <ul class="list-cm-03 mt10">
                            <li>Submit a registration form to the Program</li>
                            <li>Facilitate the local energy auditing firm and international consultants from the DEPP3 Program to conduct a preliminary survey at the enterprise premises</li>
                            <li>Provide the necessary information to the local energy auditing firm to develop a technical proposal</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="vas-support-item">
                <div>
                    <div class="vas-support-img">
                        <img src="/Content/img/vas/vas-img-02.jpg" />
                        <p class="vas-num"><span>2</span></p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="vas-support-content">
                        <p class="vas-support-name">Signing the Agreement</p>

                        <p class="mt10">Signing the voluntary agreement with the Ministry of Industry and Trade</p>

                        <p class="mt10">Refer to the VA template <a class="text-white" href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iFbYcCmdLHBf77A53gHGTDYaP_u7-1QP/view" style="text-decoration: underline;" target="_blank">HERE</a></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="vas-support-item">
                <div>
                    <div class="vas-support-img">
                        <img src="/Content/img/vas/vas-img-03.jpg" />
                        <p class="vas-num"><span>3</span></p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="vas-support-content">
                        <p class="vas-support-name">Develop energy efficiency projects</p>

                        <p class="mt10">Depending on the results of each activity, enterprises&rsquo; needs, and the Program&rsquo;s resources, the Program will provide technical support for enterprises to implement separate or all the following initiatives:</p>

                        <ul class="list-cm-03 mt10">
                            <li>Conducting energy audits in comformity with international standards</li>
                            <li>Developing pre-feasibility studies</li>
                            <li>Developing feasibility studies</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="vas-support-item">
                <div>
                    <div class="vas-support-img">
                        <img src="/Content/img/vas/vas-img-04.png" />
                        <p class="vas-num"><span>4</span></p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="vas-support-content">
                        <p class="vas-support-name">Preparing loan application</p>

                        <p class="mt10">Based on the results of the feasibility study and the enterprises&rsquo; interest, the DEPP3 Program may provide technical support for the enterprises in:</p>

                        <ul class="list-cm-03 mt10">
                            <li>Preparing loan applications</li>
                            <li>Connecting with suitable financial institutions</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
